H6623.definition:
or פִּתְרֹן; from H6622 (פָּתַר);
interpretation (of a dream)
KJV: interpretation.

H6624.definition:
of Egyptian derivation;
Pathros, a part of Egypt
KJV: Pathros.

H6625.definition:
patrial from H6624 (פַּתְרוֹס);
a Pathrusite, or inhabitant of Pathros
KJV: Pathrusim.

H6626.definition:
