to mass (an army or servants)
KJV: assemble, fight, perform, muster, wait upon, war.

H6634.definition:
(Aramaic) corresponding to H6623 (פִּתְרוֹן) in the figurative sense of summoning one's wishes;
to please
KJV: will, would.

H6635.definition:
