H6643.definition:
from H6638 (צָבָה) in the sense of prominence;
splendor (as conspicuous); also a gazelle (as beautiful)
KJV: beautiful(-ty), glorious (-ry), goodly, pleasant, roe(-buck).

H6644.definition:
for H6645 (צִבְיָּה);
