KJV: against, concerning.

H6656.definition:
(Aramaic) from an unused root corresponding to H6658 (צָדָה) in the sense of intentness;
a (sinister) design
KJV: true.

H6657.definition:
from the same as H6654 (צַד); a siding;
Tsedad, a place near Palestine
KJV: Zedad.

H6658.definition:
a primitive root;
to chase; by implication, to desolate
KJV: destroy, hunt, lie in wait.

H6659.definition:
from H6663 (צָדַק); just;
